INSERT INTO game_translations (game_id, language_code, title, description) SELECT id, 'en', 'The Blackwell Deception', 'Street psychics. Their blinking neon signs are everywhere, promising love and wealth and happiness. They make a fortune preying on the gullible and milking them dry. So when these victims begin dying and leaving confused spirits behind, it can only take a genuine psychic (and her wayward spirit guide) to clean up the mess.
